ma","bi-is'mi",314],["رَبِّكَ","Tuhanmu","rabbika",10],["ٱلْعَظِيمِ","Maha Besar/Maha Agung","l-ʿaẓīmi",101]],"t":"Maka bertasbihlah dengan (menyebut) nama Tuhanmu Yang Mahabesar."}]